1
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:06,960
(Penny:)There you go.

2
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,230
(Leonard:)Are you sure
this is right?

3
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:17,370
(Penny:)Yeah, just tuck that
part in your pants;  you'll be fine.

4
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:22,410
Okay, let's go smooch some
rich, wrinkled tochis.

5
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:24,570
(Penny:)Oh, Howard, I can't believe
Bernadette let you go

6
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,510
(Penny:)to a fancy party
wearing a dickey.

7
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:29,710
(Howard:)Excuse me, my girlfriend
doesn't pick out my clothes.

8
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,980
(Howard:)My mother does.

9
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,690
(Leonard:)Oh. We should
get going.

10
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:34,800
(Howard:)What about Sheldon?

11
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,870
(Sheldon:)Sheldon is not going.

12
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,710
(Leonard:)Really? What do we tell Siebert?

13
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:42,660
(Sheldon:)Tell him Dr. Cooper feels
that the best use of his time

14
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:45,510
(Sheldon:)is to employ his rare
and precious mental faculties

15
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:49,270
(Sheldon:)to tear the mask off nature
and stare at the face of God.

16
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:53,770
(Penny:)Sheldon, it's Saturday night,
you'll be doing laundry.

17
00:00:53,770 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)Don't tell him that,
tell him the mask thing.

